From 50a6df2bef5c06e7f38107dedd9214e61ff58df1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Remby Lis <153624059+Remygred@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 09:24:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kv): default-off KV-recovery observer sidecars in
 OffloadingConnector path

Add default-off KV-recovery observer sidecars so a real preemption recovery
(preempt -> restore_start -> restore_done -> scheduler_wakeup -> admission ->
first_prefill_or_decode) can be traced with complete request-ID association:
- scheduler side: recovery admission/requeue observation + compute-context.
- worker side: compute-context consumption, first_compute child observation,
  H2D submit/completion/wait evidence.
- log hygiene: temporary diagnostics downgraded WARNING -> DEBUG.
No behavior change unless the profiler explicitly opts in.
